<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal cement sales grow 19.1 pct Jan-May -BOP.</title>
<headline>Portugal cement sales grow 19.1 pct Jan-May -BOP.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese cement sales rose 6.8 percent in May, taking the year-on-year gain in the first five months of the year to 19.1 percent, the Bank of Portugal said in its latest monthly report.</p>
<p>But the year-on-year figure was below the accumulated 22.9 percent growth in the first four months of the year.</p>
<p>The Bank gave no figure for May 1996.</p>
<p>---Lisbon Editorial, 351-1-3150035.</p>
</text>
